#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:51
msgid "Who has staff permissions: name:level pairs, comma-separated, where the level is admin, sponsor or employee. Admins can turn on admin mode. You can't remove your own admin permission here."
msgstr "Cò aig a bheil ceadan luchd-obrach: paidhrichean name:level air an sgaradh le cromagan, far a bheil an ìre na admin, sponsor no employee. 'S urrainn do rianairean am modh rianachd a chur air. Chan urrainn dhut do chead rianachd fhèin a thoirt air falbh an-seo."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:55
msgid "Moderators and staff (employees, and admins for admin mode) need two-factor sign-in turned on (preferences, security) to use their tools; until then they see a notice asking them to. Members without it are unaffected."
msgstr "Feumaidh modaratairean is luchd-obrach (luchd-obrach, agus rianairean airson a' mhodh rianachd) an clàradh a-steach dà-cheumnach a chur air (roghainnean, tèarainteachd) airson an cuid innealan a chleachdadh; gus an dèan iad sin, chì iad brath ag iarraidh orra a dhèanamh. Cha bhi buaidh air buill as aonais."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:60
msgid "How long a page for logged-out visitors may be kept and served again, in seconds, by nginx's page cache or a CDN in front of the site (logged-in visitors always get fresh pages). Lower it to show changes sooner, or 0 to stop caching pages at once. nginx's page cache has to be on (the installer's TIPPR_PAGE_CACHE_SECONDS) for a value here to do anything there."
msgstr "Dè cho fada 's a dh'fhaodar duilleag airson aoighean nach do chlàraich a-steach a chumail agus a frithealadh a-rithist, ann an diogan, le tasgadan dhuilleagan nginx no le CDN air beulaibh na làraich (gheibh aoighean a chlàraich a-steach duilleagan ùra an-còmhnaidh). Ìslich e airson atharraichean a shealltainn nas luaithe, no 0 airson stad a chur air tasgadh dhuilleagan sa bhad. Feumaidh tasgadan dhuilleagan nginx a bhith air (TIPPR_PAGE_CACHE_SECONDS an stàlaicheir) mus bi buaidh aig luach an-seo an-sin."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:67
msgid "Accounts with at least this much post karma skip the captcha."
msgstr "Leumaidh cunntasan aig a bheil co-dhiù an uiread seo de karma phuist thar a' chaptcha."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:69
msgid "Accounts with at least this much comment karma skip the captcha."
msgstr "Leumaidh cunntasan aig a bheil co-dhiù an uiread seo de karma bheachdan thar a' chaptcha."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:71
msgid "How old an account must be, in days, to create a vault (admins can always create one)."
msgstr "Dè an aois a dh'fheumas a bhith aig cunntas, ann an làithean, airson vault a chruthachadh ('s urrainn do rianairean fear a chruthachadh an-còmhnaidh)."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:74
msgid "Post karma needed to create a vault (this, or the comment karma below)."
msgstr "Karma phuist a dh'fheumar airson vault a chruthachadh (seo, no karma nam beachdan gu h-ìosal)."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:77
msgid "Comment karma needed to create a vault (this, or the post karma above)."
msgstr "Karma bheachdan a dh'fheumar airson vault a chruthachadh (seo, no karma nam post gu h-àrd)."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:80
msgid "A notice in every page's sidebar. Blank: none."
msgstr "Brath ann am bàr-taoibh gach duilleige. Falamh: chan eil gin."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:82
msgid "Messages for the \"new here?\" bar shown to logged-out visitors, each in double quotes; one is picked at random. \" / \" splits a message into a heading and a smaller second line, e.g. \"Welcome! / Pick a few vaults to subscribe to.\""
msgstr "Teachdaireachdan airson a' bhàr \"ùr an-seo?\" a chì aoighean nach do chlàraich a-steach, gach tè eadar dà chomharra-labhairt dhùbailte; thèid tè a thaghadh air thuaiream. Sgaraidh \" / \" teachdaireachd na ceann-sgrìobhadh agus dàrna loidhne nas lugha, m.e. \"Fàilte! / Tagh beagan vaults airson fo-sgrìobhadh annta.\""

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:87
msgid "A message in the info bar at the top of listings. For a site-wide banner, use the announcement on /admin/site instead."
msgstr "Teachdaireachd ann am bàr an fhiosrachaidh aig bàrr nan liostaichean. Airson bratach air feadh na làraich, cleachd am brath-naidheachd air /admin/site an àite sin."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:90
msgid "Vaults that help people find more vaults, for the explore tab: names, comma-separated."
msgstr "Vaults a chuidicheas daoine gus barrachd vaults a lorg, airson taba an rannsachaidh: ainmean, air an sgaradh le cromagan."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:93
msgid "New API apps (registered on /prefs/apps) work only for their own developers until an admin approves them on /admin/apps."
msgstr "Cha obraich aplacaidean API ùra (air an clàradh air /prefs/apps) ach dhan luchd-leasachaidh aca fhèin gus an toir rianaire aonta dhaibh air /admin/apps."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:96
msgid "How old an account must be, in days, to register an API app."
msgstr "Dè an aois a dh'fheumas a bhith aig cunntas, ann an làithean, airson aplacaid API a chlàradh."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:98
msgid "Total karma (posts and comments) needed to register an API app."
msgstr "Karma iomlan (puist is beachdan) a dh'fheumar airson aplacaid API a chlàradh."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:100
msgid "Whether registering an API app needs a verified email address."
msgstr "Am feum clàradh aplacaid API seòladh puist-d dearbhte."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:102
msgid "Votes a post or comment needs before it can count as controversial."
msgstr "Na bhòtaichean a dh'fheumas post no beachd mus tèid a mheas connspaideach."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:104
msgid "Controversial: the lowest share of upvotes (0 to 1)."
msgstr "Connspaideach: a' chuibhreann as lugha de bhòtaichean suas (0 gu 1)."

#: r2/lib/live_config_admin.py:106
msgid "Controversial: the highest share of upvotes (0 to 1)."
msgstr "Connspaideach: a' chuibhreann as motha de bhòtaichean suas (0 gu 1)."

