#: r2/lib/strings.py:75
#, python-format
msgid "that link has been submitted to multiple vaults. you can try to [submit it again](%s)."
msgstr "chaidh an ceangal seo a chur gu iomadh vault mu thràth ach is urrainn dhut [a chur a-rithist](%s)."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:77
msgid "your account has been deactivated, but we won't judge you for it."
msgstr "chaidh an cunntas agad a chur à gnìomh, ach cha toir sinn breith ort air a shon."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:80
#, python-format
msgid "Log in or sign up to connect your tippr account with %(app)s."
msgstr "Clàraich a-steach no clàraich airson an cunntas tippr agad a cheangal ri %(app)s."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:82
#, python-format
msgid "I understand and agree that registration on or use of this site constitutes agreement to its %(user_agreement)s and %(privacy_policy)s."
msgstr "Tha mi a' tuigsinn agus ag aontachadh gu bheil clàradh no cleachdadh na làraich seo 'na aonta ri %(user_agreement)s agus %(privacy_policy)s."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:84
#, python-format
msgid "to view only submissions from your friends, use [/v/friends](%s)"
msgstr "airson nach fhaic thu ach na chuir do charaidean, cleachd [/v/friends](%s)"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:86
msgid "your vault has been created"
msgstr "chaidh an vault agad a chruthachadh"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:88
#, python-format
msgid "visit [%(link)s](%(link)s) for more information"
msgstr "tadhail air [%(link)s](%(link)s) airson barrachd fiosrachaidh"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:91
msgid "you have not subscribed to any vaults."
msgstr "chan eil fo-sgrìobhadh agad ann an vault sam bith."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:92
msgid "you haven't chosen any vaults yet, so your front page shows the site's default vaults, below. subscribe or unsubscribe to make the list your own."
msgstr "cha do thagh thu vault sam bith fhathast, mar sin tha do phrìomh-dhuilleag a' sealltainn vaults bunaiteach na làraich, gu h-ìosal. fo-sgrìobh no sguir dhen fho-sgrìobhadh airson an liosta a dhèanamh agad fhèin."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:93
msgid "below are the vaults you have subscribed to."
msgstr "chì thu na vaults sa bheil fo-sgrìobhadh agad annta gu h-ìosal."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:94
msgid "below are the vaults that you are an approved submitter on."
msgstr "chì thu na vaults sa bheil thu 'nad submitter ann gu h-ìosal."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:95
msgid "below are the vaults that you have moderator access to."
msgstr "chì thu na vaults gu h-ìosal a tha cothrom modarataireachd agad orra."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:98
msgid "click the `subscribe` or `unsubscribe` buttons to choose which vaults appear on your front page."
msgstr "briog air na putanan `fo-sgrìobh` no `sguir dhen fho-sgrìobhadh` airson taghadh dè na vaults a nochdas air do phrìomh-dhuilleag."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:100
#, python-format
msgid "you're searching within the [%(vault_name)s](%(vault_link)s) vault. you can also search within [all vaults](%(all_vaults_link)s)"
msgstr "tha thu a' lorg am broinn na vault [%(vault_name)s](%(vault_link)s). 's urrainn dhut lorg am broinn [gach vault](%(all_vaults_link)s) cuideachd"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:103
#, python-format
msgid "%(author)s comments on %(title)s"
msgstr "tha %(author)s a' toirt beachd air %(title)s"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:104
#, python-format
msgid "%(title)s : %(site)s"
msgstr "%(title)s : %(site)s"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:105
#, python-format
msgid "%(score)s points and %(num_comments)s comments so far on tippr"
msgstr "%(score)s puing(ean) is %(num_comments)s beachd(an) gu ruige seo air tippr"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:107
msgid "You are submitting a link. The key to a successful submission is interesting content and a descriptive title."
msgstr "Tha ceangal ann. Tha e cudromach susbaint inntinneach is tiotal tuairisgeulach a chur air ceangal mus bi e math."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:108
msgid "You are submitting a text-based post. Speak your mind. A title is required, but expanding further in the text field is not. Beginning your title with \"vote up if\" is violation of intergalactic law."
msgstr "Tha thu a' cur post teacsa. Innis dhuinn na tha air d' inntinn. Tha feum air tiotal ach cha leig thu leas leudachadh air san raon teacsa. Briseadh laghan na Fèinne ma thòisicheas tu air tiotal le \"bhòt suas ma...\"."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:109 r2/templates/listing.html:114
msgid "Submit a new link"
msgstr "Cuir ceangal ùr"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:110 r2/templates/listing.html:115
msgid "Submit a new text post"
msgstr "Cuir post teacsa ùr"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:111
msgid "we're going to need to verify your email address for you to proceed."
msgstr "feumaidh sinn am post-d agad a dhearbhadh mus urrainn dhut leantainn air adhart."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:112
msgid "you'll be able to submit more frequently once you verify your email address"
msgstr "'s urrainn dhut rudan a chur nas trice turas a chaidh am post-d agad a dhearbhadh"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:113
msgid "your email address has been verified"
msgstr "chaidh am post-d agad a dhearbhadh"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:114
msgid "Verification failed.  Please try that again"
msgstr "Dh'fhàillig an dearbhadh. Nach fheuch thu ris a-rithist?"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:115
msgid "The email verification link you've followed is for a different user. Please log out and switch to that user or try again below."
msgstr "Tha an ceangal dearbhaidh puist-d a lean thu airson cleachdaiche eile. Clàraich a-mach is leum chun a' chleachdaiche sin no feuch ris a-rithist gu h-ìosal."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:116
msgid "Our search machines are under too much load to handle your request right now. :( Sorry for the inconvenience. Try again in a little bit -- but please don't mash reload; that only makes the problem worse."
msgstr "Tha cus ri dhèanamh aig na h-innealan luirg againn an-dràsta fhèin 's chan urrainn dhuinn dèiligeadh ris na dh'iarr thu. :( Tha sinn duilich. Nach fheuch thu ris a-rithist an ceann greis? Ach feuch is seachainn ath-luchdadh is ath-luchdadh, nì sin nas miosa cùisean fhathast."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:117
#, python-format
msgid "I couldn't understand your query, so I simplified it and searched for \"%(clean_query)s\" instead."
msgstr "Cha do thuig sinn do cheist agus rinn sinn nas simplidhe e. Chaidh lorg a dhèanamh airson \"%(clean_query)s\" 'na àite."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:118
msgid "I couldn't understand your search query. Please try again."
msgstr "Cha do thuig sinn na dh'iarr thu. Nach fheuch thu ris a-rithist?"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:119
#, python-format
msgid "You may also want to check the [search help page](%(search_help)s) for more information."
msgstr "Dh'fhaoidte gum faigh thu barrachd fiosrachaidh air [duilleag na cobharach](%(search_help)s) cuideachd."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:120
msgid "tippr uses a slightly-customized version of [Markdown](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/syntax) for formatting. See below for some basics, or check [the formatting help](/help/formatting) for more detailed help and solutions to common issues."
msgstr "Cleachdaidh tippr tionndadh beagan gnàthaichte de [Markdown](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/syntax) airson fòrmatadh. Faic gu h-ìosal airson nam bunaitean, no thoir sùil air [cobhair an fhòrmataidh](/help/formatting) airson cobhair nas mionaidiche is fuasglaidhean do dhuilgheadasan cumanta."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:121
msgid "Tippr is in \"emergency read-only mode\" right now. :( You won't be able to log in. We're sorry and are working frantically to fix the problem."
msgstr "Tha Tippr sa \"mhodh èiginn leughaidh a-mhàin\" an-dràsta. :( Cha bhi e comasach dhut clàradh a-steach. Tha sinn duilich agus tha sinn ag obair gu dian airson an duilgheadas a chàradh."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:122
msgid "this page is temporarily in read-only mode due to heavy traffic."
msgstr "chan urrainnear ach leughadh a dhèanamh an-seo an-dràsta fhèin ri linn trafaig mhòr."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:123
msgid "Your account is in a [timeout](/help/suspensions) until the site's staff lift it."
msgstr "Tha an cunntas agad ann am [fois-ùine](/help/suspensions) gus an tog luchd-obrach na làraich i."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:124
#, python-format
msgid "Your account is in a [timeout](/help/suspensions) for %(days)s."
msgstr "Tha an cunntas agad ann am [fois-ùine](/help/suspensions) airson %(days)s."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:127
msgid "You sent us a postcard! (Or something similar.) When we run out of room on our refrigerator, we might one day auction off the stuff that people sent in. Is it okay if we include your thing?"
msgstr "Chuir thu cairt-phuist thugainn! (No rudeigin mar sin.) 'S mathaid nach bi àite air fhàgail air an fhuaradair againn latha dhe na làithean 's bi againn ri fèill-reic a chumail. Am biodh e ceart gu leòr nan gabhamaid a-staigh na chuir thusa thugainn cuideachd?"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:128
#, python-format
