#: r2/lib/strings.py:138
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You're about to set up an ongoing, autorenewing subscription to tippr gold for yourself (%(user)s). \n"
"\n"
"You'll pay **%(price)s** for this, **monthly**. \n"
"\n"
">This subscription will renew automatically each month until you cancel. You may cancel at any time. If you cancel, you will not be billed for any additional months of service, and service will continue until the end of the billing period. If you cancel, you will not receive a refund for any service already paid for. Receipts will be delivered via private message in your account."
msgstr ""
"Tha thu gu bhith a' suidheachadh fo-sgrìobhadh leantainneach a dh'ath-nuadhaicheas e fhèin airson òr tippr dhut fhèin (%(user)s). \n"
"\n"
"Pàighidh tu **%(price)s** air a shon, **gach mìos**. \n"
"\n"
">Thèid am fo-sgrìobhadh seo ath-nuadhachadh gu fèin-obrachail gach mìos gus an sguir thu dheth. Faodaidh tu sgur dheth uair sam bith. Ma sguireas tu dheth, cha tèid cosgais a chur ort airson mìosan seirbheis a bharrachd, agus leanaidh an t-seirbheis gu deireadh na h-ùine-bileachaidh. Ma sguireas tu dheth, chan fhaigh thu airgead air ais airson seirbheis a chaidh a phàigheadh mu thràth. Thèid na cuidhteasan a lìbhrigeadh le teachdaireachd phrìobhaideach sa chunntas agad."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:139
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You're about to set up an ongoing, autorenewing subscription to tippr gold for yourself (%(user)s). \n"
"\n"
"You'll pay **%(price)s** for this, **yearly**. \n"
"\n"
">This subscription will renew automatically each year until you cancel. You may cancel at any time. If you cancel, you will not be billed for any additional years of service, and service will continue until the end of the billing period. If you cancel, you will not receive a refund for any service already paid for. Receipts will be delivered via private message in your account."
msgstr ""
"Tha thu gu bhith a' suidheachadh fo-sgrìobhadh leantainneach a dh'ath-nuadhaicheas e fhèin airson òr tippr dhut fhèin (%(user)s). \n"
"\n"
"Pàighidh tu **%(price)s** air a shon, **gach bliadhna**. \n"
"\n"
">Thèid am fo-sgrìobhadh seo ath-nuadhachadh gu fèin-obrachail gach bliadhna gus an sguir thu dheth. Faodaidh tu sgur dheth uair sam bith. Ma sguireas tu dheth, cha tèid cosgais a chur ort airson bliadhnaichean seirbheis a bharrachd, agus leanaidh an t-seirbheis gu deireadh na h-ùine-bileachaidh. Ma sguireas tu dheth, chan fhaigh thu airgead air ais airson seirbheis a chaidh a phàigheadh mu thràth. Thèid na cuidhteasan a lìbhrigeadh le teachdaireachd phrìobhaideach sa chunntas agad."

