#: r2/lib/strings.py:152
msgid "This page shows a history of recent activity on your account. If you notice unusual activity, you should change your password immediately. Location information is guessed from your computer's IP address and may be wildly wrong, especially for visits from mobile devices."
msgstr "Seallaidh an duilleag seo eachdraidh na gnìomhachd o chionn goirid air a' chunntas agad. Ma mhothaicheas tu do ghnìomhachd neo-àbhaisteach, bu chòir dhut am facal-faire agad atharrachadh sa bhad. Thathar a' tomhas an fhiosrachaidh mun ionad on t-seòladh IP aig a' choimpiutair agad agus dh'fhaoidte gu bheil e fada cearr, gu h-àraidh airson tadhalan o uidheaman mobile."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:153
#, python-format
