#: r2/lib/strings.py:154
msgid ""
"\n"
"These apps are authorized to access your account. Signing out of all sessions\n"
"will revoke access from all apps. You may also revoke access from individual\n"
"apps below.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Tha cothrom aig na h-aplacaidean a leanas air a' chunntas agad. Ma chlàraicheas tu\n"
"a-mach à gach seisean, thèid an cead a thoirt air falbh o gach aplacaid. 'S urrainn\n"
"dhut an cead a thoirt air falbh o aplacaid fa leth gu h-ìosail.\n"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:160
msgid "Below you will see your promotion's impression and click traffic per hour of promotion.  Please note that these traffic totals will lag behind by two to three hours, and that daily totals will be preliminary until 24 hours after the link has finished its run."
msgstr "Chì thu gu h-ìosal na seallaidhean is briogaidhean aig a' bhrosnachadh agad airson gach uair a thìde dheth. Thoir an aire gum bi na h-àireamhan seo dà no trì uairean a thìde air dheireadh, agus gum bi na h-àireamhan làitheil ro-shealladh gu 24 uair a thìde an dèidh dhan cheangal crìochnachadh."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:161 r2/lib/strings.py:162
msgid "Traffic is counted as pages are viewed, and these graphs update every few minutes."
msgstr "Thèid an trafaig a chunntadh mar a chithear duilleagan, agus thèid na grafaichean seo ùrachadh gach beagan mhionaidean."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:163
#, python-format
msgid "Questions? Email self serve support: %(email)s"
msgstr "Ceistean? Cuir post-d gun sgioba taice airson fèin-fhrithealadh: %(email)s"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:165
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Below are the traffic statistics for your vault. Each graph represents one of the following over the interval specified.\n"
"\n"
"* **pageviews** are the pages people viewed in %(vault)s, including both listing pages and comment pages (not bots, feeds or the API).\n"
"* **uniques** are how many different people made those pageviews: each logged-in member counts once, and each logged-out visitor once per address and browser.\n"
"* **subscriptions** is the number of new subscriptions that have been generated in a given day. This number is less accurate than the first two metrics, as, though we can track new subscriptions, we have no way to track unsubscriptions.\n"
"\n"
"Note: there are a couple of places outside of your vault where someone can click \"subscribe\", so it is possible (though unlikely) that the subscription count can exceed the unique count on a given day.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Seo gu h-ìosal stadastaireachd na trafaig airson na vault agad. Riochdaichidh gach graf fear dhen fheadhainn a leanas thar na h-ùine a chaidh a shònrachadh.\n"
"\n"
"* 'S e **pageviews** na duilleagan a chunnaic daoine ann an %(vault)s, a' gabhail a-steach duilleagan nan liostaichean is duilleagan nam beachdan (chan e bots, inbhirean no an API).\n"
"* 'S e **uniques** an àireamh de dhaoine eadar-dhealaichte a rinn na seallaidhean sin: thèid gach ball a chlàraich a-steach a chunntadh aon turas, agus gach aoigh nach do chlàraich a-steach aon turas airson gach seòladh is brabhsair.\n"
"* 'S e **subscriptions** an àireamh de dh'fho-sgrìobhaidhean ùra a chaidh a ghintinn air latha sònraichte. Tha an àireamh seo nas mì-chinntiche na a' chiad dà mheatrachd, oir ged as urrainn dhuinn fo-sgrìobhaidhean ùra a lorg, chan urrainn dhuinn sgur dhe fho-sgrìobhaidhean a lorg.\n"
"\n"
"An aire: tha àite no dhà taobh a-muigh na vault agad far an urrainn do chuideigin briogadh air \"fo-sgrìobh\", mar sin tha e comasach (ged nach eil e coltach) gum bi barrachd fho-sgrìobhaidhean na uniques air latha sònraichte.\n"

