#: r2/templates/adminloginsettings.html:25
msgid "Members can link a Google, Facebook, GitHub or Discord account to theirs (preferences, security) and then sign in with it instead of their password. It only signs in to accounts that linked it: nothing is matched by email address. Someone signing in with one that isn't linked yet can link it to their account with their password, or, while sign-ups are open, make a new account for it. A member with two-factor sign-in still enters their code. Settings saved here override the ini file and apply immediately."
msgstr "'S urrainn do bhuill cunntas Google, Facebook, GitHub no Discord a cheangal ris a' chunntas aca (roghainnean, tèarainteachd) agus an uairsin clàradh a-steach leis an àite am facal-faire aca. Cha chlàraich e a-steach ach do chunntasan a cheangail e: cha tèid dad a mhaidseadh a rèir seòladh puist-d. 'S urrainn do chuideigin a chlàraicheas a-steach le fear nach eil ceangailte fhathast a cheangal ris a' chunntas aca leis an fhacal-fhaire, no, fhad 's a tha an clàradh fosgailte, cunntas ùr a chruthachadh dha. Cuiridh ball aig a bheil clàradh a-steach dà-cheumnach a chòd a-steach fhathast. Thèid na roghainnean a shàbhaileas tu an-seo an àite an fhaidhle ini agus bidh iad an sàs sa bhad."

#: r2/templates/adminloginsettings.html:28
msgid "Each provider needs an OAuth app of this site's own: create one in the provider's console, add the redirect address shown below to it, and enter its client ID and secret here."
msgstr "Feumaidh gach solaraiche aplacaid OAuth aig an làrach seo fhèin: cruthaich tè ann an consoil an t-solaraiche, cuir an seòladh ath-stiùiridh a chithear gu h-ìosal rithe, agus cuir a-steach an client ID is an rùn aice an-seo."

#: r2/templates/adminloginsettings.html:42
#, python-format
msgid "offer sign in with %(provider)s"
msgstr "tairg clàradh a-steach le %(provider)s"

#: r2/templates/adminloginsettings.html:46 r2/templates/adminpaymentsettings.html:137
msgid "client ID"
msgstr "client ID"

#: r2/templates/adminloginsettings.html:54
msgid "client secret"
msgstr "client secret"

#: r2/templates/adminloginsettings.html:58
msgid "redirect address"
msgstr "seòladh ath-stiùiridh"

#: r2/templates/adminloginsettings.html:63
msgid "Google Cloud console: APIs & Services, Credentials, create an OAuth client ID (web application) and add this as an authorized redirect URI. Set up the OAuth consent screen first (scopes: email, profile, openid)."
msgstr "Google Cloud console: APIs & Services, Credentials, cruthaich OAuth client ID (web application) agus cuir seo ris mar authorized redirect URI. Suidhich an OAuth consent screen an toiseach (scopes: email, profile, openid)."

#: r2/templates/adminloginsettings.html:65
msgid "Meta for Developers: create an app with Facebook Login, and add this under Facebook Login, Settings, Valid OAuth Redirect URIs. The app ID is the client ID; the app secret is under App settings, Basic."
msgstr "Meta for Developers: cruthaich aplacaid le Facebook Login, agus cuir seo ris fo Facebook Login, Settings, Valid OAuth Redirect URIs. 'S e an app ID an client ID; tha an app secret fo App settings, Basic."

#: r2/templates/adminloginsettings.html:67
msgid "GitHub, Settings, Developer settings, OAuth Apps: register a new OAuth app (not a GitHub App) with this as its authorization callback URL. Its client ID is shown there; generate a client secret on the same page."
msgstr "GitHub, Settings, Developer settings, OAuth Apps: clàraich OAuth app ùr (chan e GitHub App) le seo mar an authorization callback URL aice. Chithear an client ID aice an-sin; gin client secret air an aon duilleag."

#: r2/templates/adminloginsettings.html:69
msgid "Discord Developer Portal: create an application, then under OAuth2 add this as a redirect. The client ID and client secret (reset it to see one) are on the same page."
msgstr "Discord Developer Portal: cruthaich application, an uairsin fo OAuth2 cuir seo ris mar redirect. Tha an client ID is an client secret (ath-shuidhich e airson fear fhaicinn) air an aon duilleag."

#: r2/templates/adminloginsettings.html:71
