#: r2/templates/adminpaymentsettings.html:90
msgid "Take payments for gold (and Give Gold, gifts and gift codes) and for sold ads with your own accounts at these providers. Turn on the ones you use and enter their API keys; buyers pick one on the payment page and pay on the provider's own page, so card details never reach this site. Settings saved here override the ini file and apply immediately."
msgstr "Gabh ri pàighidhean airson òr (agus Thoir Òr, tiodhlacan is còdan tiodhlaic) agus airson sanasan reicte leis na cunntasan agad fhèin aig na solaraichean seo. Cuir air an fheadhainn a chleachdas tu is cuir a-steach na h-iuchraichean API aca; taghaidh ceannaichean fear air duilleag a' phàighidh agus pàighidh iad air duilleag an t-solaraiche fhèin, mar sin cha ruig mion-fhiosrachadh na cairt an làrach seo gu bràth. Thèid na roghainnean a shàbhaileas tu an-seo an àite an fhaidhle ini agus bidh iad an sàs sa bhad."

#: r2/templates/adminpaymentsettings.html:93
#, python-format
msgid "Prices are in US dollars: gold is %(month)s a month and %(year)s a year (gold_month_price and gold_year_price in the ini)."
msgstr "Tha na prìsean ann an dolairean nan SA: 's e %(month)s sa mhìos agus %(year)s sa bhliadhna a th' anns an òr (gold_month_price is gold_year_price san fhaidhle ini)."

#: r2/templates/adminpaymentsettings.html:95
msgid "Webhooks are optional: payments complete when the buyer comes back from paying either way, but with webhooks they also complete if the buyer closes the window first, and refunds made in the provider's dashboard reach the site. Webhooks are only a cue: the site always asks the provider what happened."
msgstr "Tha webhooks roghainneil: thèid pàighidhean a choileanadh nuair a thilleas an ceannaiche on phàigheadh co-dhiù, ach le webhooks thèid an coileanadh cuideachd ma dhùineas an ceannaiche an uinneag an toiseach, agus ruigidh tillidhean airgid a thèid a dhèanamh air deas-bhòrd an t-solaraiche an làrach. Chan eil ann an webhooks ach sanas: faighnichidh an làrach dhen t-solaraiche dè thachair an-còmhnaidh."

#: r2/templates/adminpaymentsettings.html:99
msgid "No provider is on yet, so the payment page only offers paying with gold already bought."
msgstr "Chan eil solaraiche air fhathast, mar sin cha tairg duilleag a' phàighidh ach pàigheadh le òr a chaidh a cheannach mu thràth."

#: r2/templates/adminpaymentsettings.html:106
