msgstr "Pàighidh ceannaichean ann an USDC (stablecoin dolair) o Coinbase no wallet crypto sam bith, tro Coinbase Business checkouts. Chaidh Coinbase Commerce, an t-seann seirbheis, a dhùnadh."

