#: r2/templates/adminserverstatus.html:25
msgid "Each server reports its state here once a minute (tippr-job-server_status). Only the latest report is kept; a server that stops reporting is flagged after 3 minutes and dropped after 7 days, or forget it below once it's out of service."
msgstr "Bheir gach frithealaiche aithris air a staid an-seo aon turas sa mhionaid (tippr-job-server_status). Chan eil ach an aithris as ùire ga cumail; thèid frithealaiche a stadas a' toirt aithris a chomharrachadh an ceann 3 mionaidean agus a thoirt air falbh an ceann 7 làithean, no dìochuimhnich e gu h-ìosal nuair a bhios e às an t-seirbheis."

