msgstr "pròiseasairean"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:49 r2/templates/utils.html:243 r2/templates/utils.html:360
msgid "upload"
msgstr "luchdaich suas"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:50
msgid "up to 1 MB."
msgstr "suas gu 1 MB."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:60
msgid "use the default"
msgstr "cleachd am bunaiteach"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:69
msgid "Saved values apply right away on every web process; leave a field blank to use the ini file's value (shown greyed out) or nothing. They are kept with the site's other saved settings, so they move with backups."
msgstr "Bidh na luachan a shàbhaileas tu an sàs sa bhad air gach pròiseas lìn; fàg raon bàn airson luach an fhaidhle ini a chleachdadh (ga shealltainn ann an glas) no dad. Thèid an cumail le roghainnean sàbhailte eile na làraich, mar sin gluaisidh iad leis na lethbhric-ghlèidhidh."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:75
msgid "the site"
msgstr "an làrach"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:77
msgid "site name"
msgstr "ainm na làraich"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:77
msgid "In page titles and emails, and what links shared elsewhere say they're from."
msgstr "Ann an tiotalan dhuilleagan is puist-d, agus na their ceanglaichean a chaidh a cho-roinneadh ann an àiteachan eile on tàinig iad."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:78
msgid "The description search engines show, and the front page title unless one is set below."
msgstr "An tuairisgeul a sheallas einnseanan-luirg, agus tiotal na prìomh-dhuilleige mura tèid fear a shuidheachadh gu h-ìosal."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:79
msgid "contact address"
msgstr "seòladh conaltraidh"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:79
msgid "Shown on the contact page."
msgstr "Ga shealltainn air duilleag a' chonaltraidh."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:82
msgid "page titles"
msgstr "tiotalan dhuilleagan"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:84
msgid "front page title"
msgstr "tiotal na prìomh-dhuilleige"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:84
msgid "The front page's title in the browser and in search results. Blank: the description above."
msgstr "Tiotal na prìomh-dhuilleige sa bhrabhsair agus ann an toraidhean luirg. Falamh: an tuairisgeul gu h-àrd."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:85
msgid "title format"
msgstr "fòrmat an tiotail"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:85
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Wraps every other page's title. {title} is the page's own title and {site} the site name, e.g. \"{title} | {site}\". Blank: page titles as they are."
msgstr "Paisgidh e tiotal gach duilleige eile. 'S e {title} tiotal na duilleige fhèin agus {site} ainm na làraich, m.e. \"{title} | {site}\". Falamh: tiotalan nan duilleagan mar a tha iad."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:88
msgid "search engines"
msgstr "einnseanan-luirg"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:89
#, python-format
msgid "Google Search Console and Bing Webmaster Tools ask you to add a meta tag to prove you own the site. Paste the code, or the whole tag. Submit https://%(domain)s/sitemap.xml there as the sitemap."
msgstr "Iarraidh Google Search Console is Bing Webmaster Tools ort taga meta a chur ris airson dearbhadh gur leatsa an làrach. Cuir a-steach an còd, no an taga gu lèir. Cuir https://%(domain)s/sitemap.xml an-sin mar mhapa na làraich."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:91
msgid "Google verification"
msgstr "Dearbhadh Google"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:91
msgid "The content of the google-site-verification tag."
msgstr "Susbaint an taga google-site-verification."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:92
msgid "Bing verification"
msgstr "Dearbhadh Bing"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:92
msgid "The content of the msvalidate.01 tag."
msgstr "Susbaint an taga msvalidate.01."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:95
msgid "analytics"
msgstr "analaidheachd"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:96
msgid "The site counts its own traffic for the traffic pages (/traffic, and each vault's traffic stats) without any outside service. To use Google Analytics as well, paste its measurement ID (G-…, or the whole tag Google gives you). It isn't loaded for visitors whose browser asks not to be tracked. In some places (the EU and UK, for example) you need visitors' consent before using it; the privacy policy already says the site may use analytics."
msgstr "Cunntaidh an làrach a trafaig fhèin airson duilleagan na trafaig (/traffic, agus stadastaireachd trafaig gach vault) gun seirbheis o thaobh a-muigh. Airson Google Analytics a chleachdadh cuideachd, cuir a-steach an ID tomhais aige (G-…, no an taga gu lèir a bheir Google dhut). Cha tèid a luchdadh airson aoighean aig a bheil brabhsair a dh'iarras nach tèid an tracadh. Ann an cuid a dh'àiteachan (an AE is an RA, mar eisimpleir) feumaidh tu cead nan aoighean mus cleachd thu e; tha am poileasaidh prìobhaideachd ag ràdh mu thràth gum faod an làrach analaidheachd a chleachdadh."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:98
msgid "Google Analytics"
msgstr "Google Analytics"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:98
msgid "The measurement ID, e.g. G-ABC123XYZ. Blank: no Google Analytics."
msgstr "An ID tomhais, m.e. G-ABC123XYZ. Falamh: gun Google Analytics."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:101
msgid "announcement"
msgstr "brath-naidheachd"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:103
msgid "banner text"
msgstr "teacsa na brataich"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:103
msgid "Shown at the top of every page until someone closes it; it comes back for everyone when you change it. Blank: no banner."
msgstr "Ga shealltainn aig bàrr gach duilleige gus an dùin cuideigin e; tillidh e dhan a h-uile duine nuair a dh'atharraicheas tu e. Falamh: gun bhratach."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:104
msgid "banner link"
msgstr "ceangal na brataich"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:104
msgid "Optional: where the banner leads, e.g. a post about the change (https://... or /v/...)."
msgstr "Roghainneil: càite an toir a' bhratach daoine, m.e. post mun atharrachadh (https://... no /v/...)."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:107
msgid "new accounts"
msgstr "cunntasan ùra"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:114
msgid "Closed: the sign-up form is replaced by a notice and new accounts are refused. Existing accounts can still log in."
msgstr "Dùinte: thèid brath a chur an àite foirm a' chlàraidh agus thèid cunntasan ùra a dhiùltadh. 'S urrainn do chunntasan a tha ann mu thràth clàradh a-steach fhathast."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:119
msgid "policy pages"
msgstr "duilleagan phoileasaidhean"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:120
msgid "The user agreement, privacy policy, content policy and moderator guidelines start from the templates in docs/policies, filled in with the site name, domain and these two; where they say how to reach you, they link to sections of the contact page (/contact), which offers a message to the admins and the contact address above when it is set. They're wiki pages: edit them at /wiki/useragreement and so on. To rebuild them from the templates after changing these (this replaces any edits):"
msgstr "Tòisichidh aonta a' chleachdaiche, am poileasaidh prìobhaideachd, poileasaidh na susbainte agus riaghailtean nam modaratairean o na teamplaidean ann an docs/policies, air an lìonadh le ainm na làraich, an àrainn agus an dà rud seo; far an innis iad mar a ruigear thu, ceanglaidh iad ri earrannan de dhuilleag a' chonaltraidh (/contact), a tha a' tairgsinn teachdaireachd dha na rianairean agus an seòladh conaltraidh gu h-àrd nuair a bhios e suidhichte. 'S e duilleagan uicipeid a th' annta: deasaich iad aig /wiki/useragreement is mar sin air adhart. Airson an ath-thogail o na teamplaidean an dèidh dhut iad seo atharrachadh (cuiridh seo an àite deasachadh sam bith):"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:123
msgid "operator"
msgstr "gnìomhaiche"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:123
msgid "Who runs the site, by legal name (a company, or your own name). Blank: the site name."
msgstr "Cò ruitheas an làrach, leis an ainm laghail (companaidh, no d' ainm fhèin). Falamh: ainm na làraich."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:124
msgid "governing law"
msgstr "lagh riaghlaidh"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:124
msgid "Whose laws the policies are under, e.g. \"the State of New York\" or \"England and Wales\". Blank: wherever the operator is established."
msgstr "Fo laghan cò a tha na poileasaidhean, m.e. \"Alba\" no \"Sasainn is a' Chuimrigh\". Falamh: ge b' e càite a bheil an gnìomhaiche stèidhichte."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:131 r2/templates/vaultstylesheet.html:120 r2/templates/vaultstylesheetsource.html:46
msgid "images"
msgstr "dealbhan"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:132
msgid "Each image is saved on its own as soon as you choose it (the save button above is only for the settings above it). Uploading one replaces the last."
msgstr "Thèid gach dealbh a shàbhaladh leis fhèin cho luath 's a thaghas tu e (tha am putan sàbhalaidh gu h-àrd dìreach airson nan roghainnean os a chionn). Ma luchdaicheas tu fear suas, thèid e an àite an fhir mu dheireadh."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:134
msgid "logo"
msgstr "suaicheantas"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:134
msgid "Shown at most 48 pixels high in the header; a transparent background works best. Vaults with their own header image show that instead."
msgstr "Ga shealltainn 48 piogsail a dh'àirde air a' char as motha sa bhann-cinn; 's e cùlaibh trìd-shoilleir as fheàrr. Seallaidh vaults aig a bheil an dealbh bann-cinn aca fhèin sin na àite."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:134
msgid "The site uses the default tippr logo."
msgstr "Tha an làrach a' cleachdadh suaicheantas bunaiteach tippr."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:136
msgid "favicon"
msgstr "favicon"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:136
msgid "The icon in browser tabs and bookmarks. A square PNG of 192 or 512 pixels works everywhere."
msgstr "An ìomhaigheag ann an tabaichean a' bhrabhsair is comharran-lìn. Obraichidh PNG ceàrnagach de 192 no 512 piogsail anns a h-uile àite."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:136
msgid "The site uses the default tippr icon."
msgstr "Tha an làrach a' cleachdadh ìomhaigheag bhunaiteach tippr."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:138
msgid "share image"
msgstr "dealbh co-roinnidh"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:138
msgid "The picture shown when the front page or a vault is shared on social media or in chat apps (posts use their own image when they have one). 1200 by 630 pixels works best."
msgstr "An dealbh a chithear nuair a thèid a' phrìomh-dhuilleag no vault a cho-roinneadh air meadhanan sòisealta no ann an aplacaidean cabadaich (cleachdaidh puist an dealbh aca fhèin ma bhios fear aca). 'S e 1200 air 630 piogsail as fheàrr."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:138
msgid "Shared links show the tippr icon."
msgstr "Seallaidh ceanglaichean co-roinnte ìomhaigheag tippr."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:140
msgid "Spam protection (captcha and CleanTalk)"
msgstr "Dìon o spama (captcha is CleanTalk)"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:146 r2/templates/prefoptions.html:157 r2/templates/promotelinkbase.html:251
msgid "media"
msgstr "meadhanan"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:149
msgid "The domain is also part of the web server configuration, the TLS certificate and login cookies, so it can't be changed here. To move the site to a new domain (for example after restoring a backup on a new server), point the new domain at the server and re-run the installer with it:"
msgstr "Tha an àrainn na pàirt de rèiteachadh an fhrithealaiche-lìn, de theisteanas TLS agus de bhriosgaidean a' chlàraidh a-steach cuideachd, mar sin chan urrainnear atharrachadh an-seo. Airson an làrach a ghluasad gu àrainn ùr (mar eisimpleir an dèidh lethbhreac-glèidhidh aiseag air frithealaiche ùr), stiùir an àrainn ùr chun an fhrithealaiche agus ruith an stàlaichear a-rithist leatha:"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:153
msgid "It keeps the data, passwords and secrets, and updates the config, nginx and the certificate. Everyone has to log in again on the new domain."
msgstr "Cumaidh e an dàta, na faclan-faire is na rùintean, agus ùraichidh e an rèiteachadh, nginx is an teisteanas. Feumaidh a h-uile duine clàradh a-steach a-rithist air an àrainn ùr."

#: r2/templates/adminsupport.html:37
#, python-format
msgid "Support isn't set up: admin_message_acct in the ini is %(acct)s, not a vault. Set it to a vault, e.g. /v/siteadmins, and re-run the installer (it creates the vault)."
msgstr "Chan eil an taic air a suidheachadh: tha admin_message_acct san fhaidhle ini %(acct)s, chan e vault. Suidhich e gu vault, m.e. /v/siteadmins, agus ruith an stàlaichear a-rithist (cruthaichidh e an vault)."

#: r2/templates/adminsupport.html:39
#, python-format
msgid "The admin vault %(acct)s doesn't exist yet. Re-run the installer, or run scripts/create_default_vaults.py, to create it."
msgstr "Chan eil vault nan rianairean %(acct)s ann fhathast. Ruith an stàlaichear a-rithist, no ruith scripts/create_default_vaults.py, airson a cruthachadh."

#: r2/templates/adminsupport.html:41
#, python-format
msgid "Messages to %(acct)s (the contact page's \"message the admins\" links) become tickets here. Replies reach the member as messages from %(acct)s, without your name."
msgstr "Bidh teachdaireachdan gu %(acct)s (ceanglaichean \"cuir teachdaireachd dha na rianairean\" air duilleag a' chonaltraidh) nan tiogaidean an-seo. Ruigidh freagairtean am ball mar theachdaireachdan o %(acct)s, gun d' ainm."

