#: r2/templates/gilding.html:38
msgid "Giving [tippr gold](/gold/about) is referred to as 'gilding'. You can either give tippr gold directly to a user or gild one of their posts or comments."
msgstr "Canar \"òradh\" ri [toirt seachad òir](/gold/about). 'S urrainn dhut òr tippr a thoirt do chleachdaiche no post no beachd aca òradh."

#: r2/templates/gilding.html:41
msgid "How do I gild someone?"
msgstr "Ciamar a dh'òraicheas mi cuideigin?"

#: r2/templates/gilding.html:43
msgid "You can click the 'give gold' link directly below a submission:"
msgstr "'S urrainn dhut briogadh air a' cheangal \"thoir òir\" fo phost no beachd:"

