msgid "How much does it cost?"
msgstr "Dè na chosgas e?"

#: r2/templates/gilding.html:60
#, python-format
msgid "A single gilding costs %(price)s. If you plan to do a lot you can get a discount if you [buy gold ahead](/coins) to give later."
msgstr "Cosgaidh aon tabhartas òir %(price)s. Ma tha thu an dùil mòran a thoirt seachad, gheibh thu lasachadh ma [cheannaicheas tu òr ro làimh](/coins) airson a thoirt seachad às dèidh sin."

#: r2/templates/gilding.html:63
msgid "What is Give Gold?"
msgstr "Dè th' ann an Thoir Òr?"

#: r2/templates/gilding.html:64
msgid "Gold you buy to give away later: each month of it gives someone one month of tippr gold. Kept as a balance on your account, it lets you give gold without entering payment information each time."
msgstr "Òr a cheannaicheas tu airson a thoirt seachad às dèidh sin: bheir gach mìos dheth mìos de dh'òr tippr do chuideigin. Ga chumail mar chothromachadh sa chunntas agad, leigidh e leat òr a thoirt seachad gun fhiosrachadh pàighidh a chur a-steach gach turas."

#: r2/templates/gilding.html:64
msgid "Buying a year of it at once also lowers the cost of each gilding."
msgstr "Ma cheannaicheas tu bliadhna dheth aig an aon àm, ìslichidh sin cosgais gach tabhartais cuideachd."

