#: r2/templates/goldabout.html:27
#, python-format
msgid "tippr gold is our premium membership: %(month)s a month or %(year)s a year. It keeps the site running, and gives you these extras for as long as you have it."
msgstr "'S e òr tippr am ballrachd premium againn: %(month)s sa mhìos no %(year)s sa bhliadhna. Cumaidh e an làrach a' dol, agus bheir e na rudan a bharrachd seo dhut fhad 's a bhios e agad."

