msgid "New comments highlighted"
msgstr "Beachdan ùra air an soillseachadh"

#: r2/templates/goldabout.html:37
msgid "When you come back to a post, the comments made since your last visit are highlighted, so you can catch up quickly."
msgstr "Nuair a thilleas tu gu post, thèid na beachdan a chaidh a dhèanamh on turas mu dheireadh a thadhail thu a shoillseachadh, airson 's gun ruig thu suas gu luath."

