msgid "Save categories"
msgstr "Roinnean-seòrsa sàbhalaidh"

#: r2/templates/goldabout.html:40
msgid "Sort the posts and comments you save into your own categories, and browse your saved items one category at a time."
msgstr "Seòrsaich na puist is beachdan a shàbhaileas tu ann an roinnean-seòrsa agad fhèin, agus brabhsaich na nithean sàbhailte agad aon roinn-seòrsa aig an aon àm."

#: r2/templates/goldabout.html:42
msgid "Filter /v/all"
msgstr "Criathraich /v/all"

#: r2/templates/goldabout.html:43
msgid "Leave vaults you're not interested in out of /v/all by adding them to the address with a minus sign, e.g. [/v/all-funny-pics](/v/all-funny-pics)."
msgstr "Fàg vaults nach eil ùidh agad annta a-mach à /v/all le an cur ris an t-seòladh le comharra minus, m.e. [/v/all-funny-pics](/v/all-funny-pics)."

