msgstr "/v/myrandom"

#: r2/templates/goldabout.html:46
msgid "[/v/myrandom](/v/myrandom) takes you to a random vault from your own subscriptions."
msgstr "Bheir [/v/myrandom](/v/myrandom) thu gu vault air thuaiream o na fo-sgrìobhaidhean agad fhèin."

#: r2/templates/goldabout.html:48
msgid "Notes on friends"
msgstr "Nòtaichean air caraidean"

#: r2/templates/goldabout.html:49
msgid "Add a private note to each person on your friends list, to remember who they are."
msgstr "Cuir nòta prìobhaideach ri gach duine air liosta do charaidean, airson cuimhneachadh cò iad."

#: r2/templates/goldabout.html:51
msgid "Visited links remembered"
msgstr "Cuimhne air ceanglaichean air an do thadhail thu"

#: r2/templates/goldabout.html:52
msgid "Have the site remember which links you've visited, on every device you use (turn on \"remember what links I've visited\" in your preferences)."
