#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:43
msgid "two-factor authentication"
msgstr "dearbhadh dà-cheumnach"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:46
msgid "two-factor authentication is **on**. you're asked for a code from one of your methods below when changing your password or email address, and when linking or unlinking a sign-in. a code you enter counts for 15 minutes."
msgstr "tha an dearbhadh dà-cheumnach **air**. thèid iarraidh ort còd o fhear de na dòighean agad gu h-ìosal nuair a dh'atharraicheas tu am facal-faire no an seòladh puist-d agad, agus nuair a cheanglas tu no a dhì-cheanglas tu clàradh a-steach. bidh còd a chuireas tu a-steach dligheach fad 15 mionaid."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:50
msgid "your methods"
msgstr "na dòighean agad"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:55
msgid "kind_name"
msgstr "kind_name"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:56
#, python-format
msgid "added %(when)s"
msgstr "air a chur ris %(when)s"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:58
#, python-format
msgid "last used %(when)s"
msgstr "air a chleachdadh mu dheireadh %(when)s"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:78
msgid "Removing your only method turns two-factor off, so it needs your password too."
msgstr "Ma bheir thu air falbh an aon dòigh agad, thèid an dà-cheumnach a chur dheth, mar sin feumaidh e am facal-faire agad cuideachd."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:82
msgid "add a method"
msgstr "cuir dòigh ris"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:86
msgid "also ask for a code"
msgstr "iarr còd cuideachd"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:89
msgid "when logging in, with your password or a linked account (Google, GitHub...)"
msgstr "nuair a chlàraicheas tu a-steach, leis an fhacal-fhaire agad no le cunntas ceangailte (Google, GitHub...)"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:90
#, python-format
msgid "you can choose to skip it for %(days)s days on a device you trust"
msgstr "'s urrainn dhut taghadh a leum fad %(days)s là(ithean) air uidheam earbsach"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:94
msgid "when saving your preferences"
msgstr "nuair a shàbhaileas tu na roghainnean agad"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:98
msgid "when submitting a post"
msgstr "nuair a chuireas tu post"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:100
msgid "a code you enter counts for 15 minutes, so you aren't asked again and again. apps you've allowed (OAuth) aren't asked."
msgstr "bidh còd a chuireas tu a-steach dligheach fad 15 mionaid, airson nach tèid iarraidh ort a-rithist 's a-rithist. cha tèid iarraidh air aplacaidean dhan tug thu cead (OAuth)."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:107
msgid "recovery codes"
msgstr "còdan aisig"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:109
msgid "Save these recovery codes somewhere safe (print them, or keep them in a password manager). Each one works once in place of a code from your app, if you lose your phone. They won't be shown again."
msgstr "Sàbhail na còdan aisig seo ann an àite sàbhailte (clò-bhuail iad, no cùm iad ann am manaidsear fhaclan-faire). Obraichidh gach fear aon turas an àite còd on aplacaid agad, ma chailleas tu am fòn agad. Cha tèid an sealltainn a-rithist."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:117
msgid "Recovery codes work once each in place of a code from your app, if you lose your phone."
msgstr "Obraichidh gach còd aisig aon turas an àite còd on aplacaid agad, ma chailleas tu am fòn agad."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:119
#, python-format
msgid "You have %(count)s left."
msgstr "Tha %(count)s agad air fhàgail."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:121
msgid "You have none left: make new ones now."
msgstr "Chan eil gin agad air fhàgail: dèan feadhainn ùra an-dràsta."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:127
msgid "make new recovery codes"
msgstr "dèan còdan aisig ùra"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:131
msgid "Making new ones stops the old ones working."
msgstr "Ma nì thu feadhainn ùra, stadaidh na seann fheadhainn ag obair."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:137
msgid "turn it off"
msgstr "cuir dheth e"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:138
msgid "to turn it off (removing every method and the recovery codes), enter your password and a code."
msgstr "airson a chur dheth (a' toirt air falbh gach dòigh is na còdan aisig), cuir a-steach am facal-faire agad agus còd."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:152
msgid "turn off"
msgstr "cuir dheth"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:156
msgid "This site asks moderators and staff to use two-factor sign-in: your moderator tools work again once it's on."
msgstr "Iarraidh an làrach seo air modaratairean is luchd-obrach an clàradh a-steach dà-cheumnach a chleachdadh: obraichidh na h-innealan modarataireachd agad a-rithist cho luath 's a bhios e air."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:158
msgid "with two-factor authentication on, changing your password or email address, and linking or unlinking a sign-in, also need a second step: a code from an authenticator app on your phone (Google Authenticator, Authy, 1Password and the like). someone who learns your password, or gets into a linked Google or Facebook account, can't take over your account here. you can add more than one method, and remove them later."
msgstr "leis an dearbhadh dà-cheumnach air, feumaidh atharrachadh an fhacail-fhaire no an t-seòlaidh puist-d, agus ceangal no dì-cheangal clàraidh a-steach, dàrna ceum cuideachd: còd o aplacaid dearbhaidh air an fhòn agad (Google Authenticator, Authy, 1Password is an leithid). chan urrainn do chuideigin a dh'fhaighneas am facal-faire agad, no a gheibh a-steach do chunntas Google no Facebook ceangailte, an cunntas agad an-seo a ghabhail thairis. 's urrainn dhut barrachd air aon dòigh a chur ris, agus an toirt air falbh às dèidh sin."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:168
msgid "To add an authenticator app, enter a code from one of your methods first."
msgstr "Airson aplacaid dearbhaidh a chur ris, cuir a-steach còd o fhear de na dòighean agad an toiseach."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:170
msgid "To start, enter your password."
msgstr "Airson tòiseachadh, cuir a-steach am facal-faire agad."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:179
msgid "add an authenticator app"
msgstr "cuir aplacaid dearbhaidh ris"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:186
msgid "Or add a passkey: your phone, computer or security key confirms it's you with a fingerprint, face or PIN."
msgstr "No cuir iuchair-fhaire ris: dearbhaidh am fòn, an coimpiutair no an iuchair thèarainteachd agad gur tusa a th' ann le lorg-meòir, aodann no PIN."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:188
msgid "Enter a code from one of your methods first."
msgstr "Cuir a-steach còd o fhear de na dòighean agad an toiseach."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:190
msgid "Enter your password first."
msgstr "Cuir a-steach am facal-faire agad an toiseach."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:198
msgid "name (optional)"
msgstr "ainm (roghainneil)"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:199
msgid "add a passkey"
msgstr "cuir iuchair-fhaire ris"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:206
msgid "scan the QR code with your authenticator app, or enter the key below in it. you WILL NOT have another chance to see this key."
msgstr "sganaich an còd QR leis an aplacaid dearbhaidh agad, no cuir an iuchair gu h-ìosal a-steach innte. CHAN FHAIGH thu cothrom eile an iuchair seo fhaicinn."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:209
msgid "(optional, like phone or work)"
msgstr "(roghainneil, mar fòn no obair)"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:213
msgid "code from the app"
msgstr "còd on aplacaid"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:227
msgid "sign in with another account"
msgstr "clàraich a-steach le cunntas eile"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:229
msgid "Link a Google, Facebook, GitHub or Discord account to sign in with it instead of your password. It only signs in to this account, and you can unlink it at any time. Your password keeps working."
msgstr "Ceangail cunntas Google, Facebook, GitHub no Discord airson clàradh a-steach leis an àite an fhacail-fhaire agad. Cha chlàraich e a-steach ach dhan chunntas seo, agus 's urrainn dhut a dhì-cheangal uair sam bith. Cumaidh am facal-faire agad ag obair."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:231
msgid "Linked. You can now sign in with it on the login page."
msgstr "Ceangailte. 'S urrainn dhut clàradh a-steach leis air duilleag a' chlàraidh a-steach a-nis."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:234
msgid "Linking or unlinking needs your two-factor code (one you entered in the last 15 minutes counts)."
msgstr "Feumaidh ceangal no dì-cheangal an còd dà-cheumnach agad (tha fear a chuir thu a-steach sna 15 mionaidean mu dheireadh gu leòr)."

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:242
msgid "linked"
msgstr "ceangailte"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:254
msgid "unlink"
msgstr "dì-cheangail"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:259
msgid "not linked"
msgstr "gun cheangal"

#: r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:266 r2/templates/prefsecurity.html:270
#, python-format
msgid "link %(provider)s"
msgstr "ceangail %(provider)s"

#: r2/templates/prefupdate.html:33
